#, machine, plain1
msgid "An admin marked this as a child account. It has the child lock: the Child word filter, which hides profanity and anything marked sensitive, and some features are off. You can lift it by confirming your age in Settings > Content."
msgstr "Admin je to označil kot otroški račun. Ima otrokovo ključavnico: filter za otroško besedo, ki skriva psovko in vse, kar je zaznamovano občutljivo, in nekatere funkcije so izključene. Lahko ga dvignete tako, da potrdite starost v Nastavitve > Vsebina."

#, machine, plain1
