msgstr "Če ste stari 18 let ali več, to povejte in roditelja ali skrbnika boste prosili, naj vam izda račun."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "If you don't have your 2FA device, enter one of your backup codes instead. Each backup code works once. An account that never made backup codes can enter its Recovery Code, which also turns 2FA off."
msgstr "Če nimate svojega 2FA naprava, vnesite eno od vaših varnostnih kod namesto. Vsaka varnostna koda deluje enkrat. Račun, ki ni nikoli naredil varnostne kode, lahko vnese svojo kodo za obnovitev, ki prav tako izklopi 2FA."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "If you forget your password, your recovery code, or a browser where you've used chat, brings your old messages back. The code can't be shown again: this site never has it. A new one replaces it."
msgstr "Če pozabite geslo, kodo za okrevanje ali brskalnik, kjer ste uporabljali klepet, vrne stara sporočila. Kode ni več mogoče prikazati: ta stran je nikoli nima. Nova ga zamenja."

