msgid "It leaves the site's pages. If it is less than five minutes old and nobody else has commented on it, it is erased: only you and the site's admins can open a private copy, for 90 days. Otherwise what it said stays in the Log as Anonymous, with no name and no link, and anyone can read it there."
msgstr "Strani pušča. Če je stara manj kot pet minut in nihče drug ni komentiral, je izbrisana: samo vi in administratorji spletne strani lahko odprejo zasebno kopijo, za 90 dni. Sicer pa tisto, kar je pisalo, ostane v Logu kot Anonimno, brez imena in povezave, in tam ga lahko vsakdo prebere."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It leaves your profile, feeds and guilds. If it is less than five minutes old and nobody else has commented, it is erased: only you and the site's admins can open a private copy, for 90 days. Otherwise what it said stays in the Log as Anonymous, with no name and no link, and anyone can read it there."
msgstr "Opušča tvoj profil, hrano in guldnerje. Če je star manj kot pet minut in nihče drug ni komentiral, je izbrisan: samo vi in administratorji spletne strani lahko odprejo zasebno kopijo, za 90 dni. Sicer pa tisto, kar je pisalo, ostane v Logu kot Anonimno, brez imena in povezave, in tam ga lahko vsakdo prebere."

