msgid "The account @%(name)s is made. They sign in with the username and password you gave."
msgstr "Račun.%(name)s je narejen. Vpišejo se z vašim uporabniškim imenom in geslom."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The account age must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Starost računa mora biti celo število dni, od 0 do %(max)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The account is used as always: only posts from these feeds are made by themselves, each marked as automated."
msgstr "Račun se uporablja kot vedno: samo delovna mesta iz teh virov so izdelana sama, vsaka označena kot avtomatizirana."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The account no longer exists."
msgstr "Račun ne obstaja več."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The accounts on this list keep it to themselves."
msgstr "Računi na tem seznamu ga hranijo zase."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The admins said: %(note)s"
msgstr "Upravniki so rekli: %(note)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The age check didn't finish. Nothing has changed, and you can try again."
msgstr "Ček za starost še ni končan. Nič se ni spremenilo in lahko poskusite znova."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The age check found that you are under the youngest age allowed to have an account where you are."
msgstr "Pri pregledu starosti je bilo ugotovljeno, da ste mlajši od najmlajših let, ki lahko imajo račun, kjer ste."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The age check found that you're under 18, so the child lock stays on."
msgstr "Ček je ugotovil, da si mlajši od 18 let, zato ključavnica ostane prižgana."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The age check found that you're under 18. Accounts here are for people 18 or over, so this account was closed."
msgstr "Ček je ugotovil, da si mlajši od 18 let. Računi tukaj so za ljudi 18 ali več, tako da je bil račun zaprt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The author"
msgstr "Avtor"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The author of an anonymous post can't be added."
msgstr "Avtorja anonimnega posta ni mogoče dodati."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The author says this is commercial promotion: a paid partnership, sponsorship, affiliate link, or advertising of their own products or services"
msgstr "Avtor pravi, da gre za komercialno promocijo: plačano partnerstvo, sponzorstvo, affiliate link ali oglaševanje lastnih izdelkov ali storitev"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The author says this was made with AI"
msgstr "Avtor pravi, da je bilo to narejeno z AI"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The author turned comments off for this post."
msgstr "Avtor je izključil komentarje za to objavo."

#. %(names)s is a comma-separated list of the draft's authors
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The authors agreed to invite you: %(names)s."
msgstr "Avtorji so se strinjali, da vas povabijo: %(names)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The auto-moderation was saved."
msgstr "Avtomoderacija je bila rešena."

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "The ban relies on %(num)s of your anonymous posts and comments. If a second administrator approves (or, on a site with a single administrator, its owner), the Log will name your account beside them. %(which_link)s"
msgstr "Prepoved se opira na %(num)s vaših anonimnih objav in komentarjev. Če drugi administrator odobri (ali na spletni strani z enim administratorjem, lastnikom), bo dnevnik poleg njih imenoval vaš račun. %(which_link)s"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The base URL is <code>%(url)s</code>"
msgstr "Osnova URL m <code>%(url)s</code>"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The board is open while the Space is live."
msgstr "Plošča je odprta, medtem ko je Vesolje v živo."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The body can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The body can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Telo je lahko največ %(num)s lik."
msgstr[1] "Telo je lahko največ %(num)s lika."
msgstr[2] "Telo je lahko največ %(num)s znakov."
msgstr[3] "Telo je lahko največ %(num)s znakov."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The bot @%(name)s you proposed was not approved."
msgstr "Bot @%(name)s, ki ste ga predlagali, ni bil odobren."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The bot @%(name)s you proposed was not approved. The admins said: %(note)s"
msgstr "Bot @%(name)s, ki ste ga predlagali, ni bil odobren. Upravitelji so rekli: %(note)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The bot already reads that feed."
msgstr "Bot že bere to krmo."

#, python-format
msgid "The bot you proposed, [@%(name)s](/@%(name)s), was approved. It is run by the site from now on and starts posting from its feeds within a few minutes. Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The bot's account no longer exists."
msgstr "Botov račun ne obstaja več."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The bot's owner can't run it right now."
msgstr "Lastnik robota ga zdaj ne more voditi."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The category %(category)s was deleted; its channels stay."
msgstr "Kategorija %(category)s je bila izbrisana; njeni kanali ostanejo."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The category %(category)s was made."
msgstr "Kategorija %(category)s je bila narejena."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The category was renamed %(category)s."
msgstr "Kategorija je bila preimenovana v %(category)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The coins go to the founder, <a href=\"%(url)s\">@%(name)s</a>."
msgstr "Kovanci gredo ustanovitelju, <a href=\"%(url)s\">@%(name)s</a>."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The coins you earn from tips, paid circles and the creator fund, for the last 30 days and all time."
msgstr "Kovanci, ki jih zaslužite iz nasvetov, plačanih krogov in sklada ustvarjalca, zadnjih 30 dni in ves čas."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The comment stays where it is, with your name taken off it. Everyone who saw it with your name still knows it was you."
msgstr "Komentar ostane, kjer je, s tvojim imenom. Vsi, ki so ga videli s tvojim imenom, še vedno vedo, da si bil ti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The copy other people forwarded to guilds will stay there."
msgid_plural "The %(num)s copies other people forwarded to guilds will stay there."
msgstr[0] "Kopija, ki so jo drugi poslali v Guilds, bo ostala tam."
msgstr[1] "Dva izvoda, ki so ju drugi poslali guldnom, bosta ostala tam."
msgstr[2] "Trije izvodi, ki so jih drugi poslali v Guilds, bodo ostali tam."
msgstr[3] "%(num)s izvodov, ki so jih drugi poslali guldnom, bo ostalo tam."

#. %(guilds)s is a list of guild names, such as "+a, +b and +c"
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The copy you forwarded to %(guilds)s will be taken down."
msgid_plural "The copies you forwarded to %(guilds)s will be taken down."
msgstr[0] "Kopija, ki ste jo posredovali v %(guilds)s bo snela."
msgstr[1] "Kopije, ki ste jih posredovali %(guilds)s, boste vzeli dol."
msgstr[2] "Kopije, ki ste jih posredovali %(guilds)s, boste vzeli dol."
msgstr[3] "Kopije, ki ste jih posredovali %(guilds)s, boste vzeli dol."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The dates leave no days."
msgstr "Datumi ne puščajo nobenih dni."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The decision stands"
msgstr "Odločitev velja"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The decisions made about it, newest first: who, when, where, which rule and why. It never shows the title or the text of what was hidden or removed."
msgstr "Odločitve o tem, najnovejše najprej: kdo, kdaj, kje, kaj in zakaj. Nikoli ne prikazuje naslova ali besedila tistega, kar je bilo skrito ali odstranjeno."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The draft has changes the post doesn't show yet."
msgstr "Osnutek ima spremembe post še ne kaže."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The earlier versions aren't shown while this is hidden."
msgstr "Zgodnejše različice niso prikazane, medtem ko je to skrito."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The earlier versions aren't shown: this was deleted and its text has been cleared."
msgstr "Zgodnejše različice niso prikazane: to je bilo izbrisano in njegovo besedilo očiščeno."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The feed %(url)s for your account's automated posting was approved: it is read from now on."
msgstr "Vir %(url)s za avtomatizirano objavo vašega računa je bil odobren: od zdaj naprej se bere."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The feed %(url)s for your account's automated posting was not approved."
msgstr "Vir %(url)s za avtomatsko objavo vašega računa ni bil odobren."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The feed %(url)s for your bot @%(name)s was approved: it is read from now on."
msgstr "Vir %(url)s za vašega robota @%(name)s je bil odobren: od zdaj naprej se bere."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The feed %(url)s for your bot @%(name)s was not approved."
msgstr "Feed %(url)s za vašega robota @ %(name)s ni bil odobren."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The feed answered with an error (%(status)s)."
msgstr "Vir je odgovoril z napako (%(status)s)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed asked us to slow down."
msgstr "Viri so nas prosili, naj upočasnimo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed did not answer in time."
msgstr "Krma ni odgovorila pravočasno."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed is unavailable for now."
msgstr "Za zdaj ni na voljo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server answered with a redirect, which is not followed."
msgstr "Strežnik vira se je odzval s preusmeritvijo, ki ji ne sledi."

#. status is an HTTP status code, such as 404
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The feed server answered with an error (%(status)s)."
msgstr "Strežnik vira je odgovoril z napako (%(status)s)."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The feed server answered with more than %(num)s post at once."
msgid_plural "The feed server answered with more than %(num)s posts at once."
msgstr[0] "Strežnik vira je odgovoril z več kot %(num)s mestom naenkrat."
msgstr[1] "Strežnik vira je odgovoril z več kot %(num)s objav naenkrat."
msgstr[2] "Strežnik vira je odgovoril z več kot %(num)s objav naenkrat."
msgstr[3] "Strežnik vira je odgovoril z več kot %(num)s objav naenkrat."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server did not answer in time."
msgstr "Strežnik ni odgovoril pravočasno."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server took too long to answer."
msgstr "Strežnik je predolgo odgovarjal."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer has no list of posts."
msgstr "Odgovor strežnika vira nima seznama objav."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer holds something that is not a post id."
msgstr "Odgovor strežnika vsebuje nekaj, kar ni post ID."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer is not JSON."
msgstr "Odgovor strežnika ni JSON."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer is not a JSON object."
msgstr "Odgovor strežnika ni predmet JSON."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's answer is too large."
msgstr "Odgovor strežnika je prevelik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's certificate could not be checked."
msgstr "Potrdila strežnika ni bilo moč preveriti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed server's cursor is not usable."
msgstr "Kazalec strežnika ni uporaben."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's address sends it somewhere else too many times."
msgstr "Naslov ga prevečkrat pošlje drugam."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's answer is too large."
msgstr "Odgovor je prevelik."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The feed's certificate could not be checked."
msgstr "Potrdila vira ni bilo moč preveriti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The file's size is missing."
msgstr "Velikost datoteke manjka."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are approved to forward to +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Naslednji uporabniki so odobreni za posredovanje na +%(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are prohibited from participating in +%(guild)s guild chat."
msgstr "Naslednjim uporabnikom je prepovedano sodelovati v klepetu z Guildom +%(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The following users are prohibited from participating in +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Naslednjim uporabnikom je prepovedano sodelovati v programu +%(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild"
msgstr "Guild"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a category with that name."
msgstr "Guild ima že kategorijo s tem imenom."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a channel with that name."
msgstr "Guild že ima kanal s tem imenom."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild already has a role with that name."
msgstr "Guild že ima vlogo s tem imenom."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The guild's own rules for what is written in its channels, on top of the site's word filter. Guildmasters are never held to them. A message that breaks one is refused with a short reason that never says which word."
msgstr "Guildova lastna pravila za to, kar je napisano v njenih kanalih, na vrhu besednega filtra strani. Guild moderatorji nikoli ne držijo za njih. Sporočilo, ki nekoga zlomi, se zavrne s kratkim razlogom, ki nikoli ne pove katere besede."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The hold on your account was lifted. You can post, comment and vote again."
msgstr "Zadržanje vašega računa je bilo preklicano. Lahko objavite, komentar in glas znova."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The host stays on stage."
msgstr "Gostitelj ostane na odru."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The independent social platform"
msgstr "Neodvisna socialna platforma"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The internet gremlins have led you to a dark, musty dead-end. There's nothing here."
msgstr "Internetni gremlini so te pripeljali v mračno slepo ulico. Tukaj ni ničesar."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The key that opens your messages in a new app. It is locked with your password and opened here, in this browser: %(site)s never sees it. Anyone with it and your account can read your chats, so never share it."
msgstr "Ključ, ki odpira vaša sporočila v novi aplikaciji. Zaklenjen je z vašim geslom in odprt tukaj, v tem brskalniku: %(site)s ga nikoli ne vidi. Vsak z njim in vašim računom lahko bere vaše pogovore, zato jih nikoli ne delite."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link `%(link)s` is not allowed. Reason: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Povezava `%(link)s` ni dovoljena. Razlog: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link `%(link)s` is not allowed. Reason: %(reason)s."
msgstr "Povezava `%(link)s` ni dovoljena. Razlog: %(reason)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The link can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Povezava je lahko največ %(num)s znak."
msgstr[1] "Povezava je lahko največ %(num)s znaka."
msgstr[2] "Povezava je lahko največ %(num)s znakov."
msgstr[3] "Povezava je lahko največ %(num)s znakov."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Povezava ne more vsebovati uporabniškega imena ali gesla."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Povezava ne more vsebovati presledkov."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Povezava se mora začeti s https:// ali http://."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Povezava potrebuje popoln naslov, kot je primer.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list is open to members so that anyone can see what the filter hides and why. Nothing on it is removed from the site: each member's own filter decides what they see."
msgstr "Seznam je odprt za člane, tako da lahko vsakdo vidi, kaj filter skriva in zakaj. Nič na njem se ne odstrani iz mesta: vsak član sam filter odloča, kaj vidi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list isn't shown on the Child filter"
msgstr "Seznam ni prikazan na otroškem filtru"

#, python-format
msgid "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coin every 30 days."
msgid_plural "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coins every 30 days."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The most voted posts of the last seven days."
msgstr "Najbolj izglasovana delovna mesta zadnjih sedmih dni."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The name %(host)s could not be found."
msgstr "Ime %(host)s ni bilo najdeno."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The newest of what they have done. Only the names of who they chat with are shown, never what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted."
msgstr "Najnovejše, kar so naredili. Prikazana so samo imena, s katerimi klepetajo, nikoli kaj pravi klepet: klepeti so šifrirani."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The number of an anonymous author"
msgstr "Številka anonimnega avtorja"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The number of items you confirmed doesn't match what was chosen. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Število predmetov, ki ste jih potrdili, se ne ujema z izbranim. Nič se ni spremenilo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The numbers are always shown on your profile. This decides who can open each list and see the accounts on it. An account is only listed where its own setting allows it too."
msgstr "Številke so vedno prikazane na vašem profilu. S tem se odloči, kdo lahko odpre vsak seznam in vidi račune na njem. Račun je naveden samo tam, kjer ga omogoča tudi njegova nastavitev."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The open-source platform for independent internet communities"
msgstr "Odprtokodna platforma za neodvisne internetne skupnosti"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The original content is not retained anywhere, including in this history."
msgstr "Prvotna vsebina se nikjer ne ohrani, tudi v tej zgodovini."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The other authors of a shared draft removed you as an author. What you wrote stays credited to you."
msgstr "Drugi avtorji skupnega osnutka so vas kot avtorja odstranili. Kar si napisal, ti ostane v čast."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner deletes a channel instead of leaving it."
msgstr "Lastnik izbriše kanal, namesto da bi ga zapustil."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner's role can't be changed."
msgstr "Lastnikove vloge ni mogoče spremeniti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The page's current text isn't shown here; what you save replaces it."
msgstr "Trenutne besedilo strani ni prikazano tukaj; kar shranite, ga nadomesti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture could not be stored. Try again later."
msgstr "Slike ni bilo moč shraniti. Poskusi kasneje."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture goes to your own linked storage, not to this site. You can add a few words under it."
msgstr "Slika gre v vaše povezano skladišče, ne na to stran. Pod njo lahko dodate nekaj besed."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture you chose"
msgstr "Slika, ki si jo izbral"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post appears on the profile of whoever publishes it first. Optionally forward it into guilds for community discussion: each guild gets its own independent copy with its own votes and comments. Guilds are forwarded to when the draft is first published."
msgstr "Postava se pojavi na profilu tistega, ki jo objavi prvi. Neobvezno ga pošljite v guldne za pogovore v skupnosti: vsak guld dobi svojo samostojno kopijo s svojimi glasovi in komentarji. Guilds se pošljejo, ko je osnutek prvič objavljen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post carries your name and is listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your name."
msgstr "Post nosi vaše ime in je naveden na vašem profilu. Glasove, komentarje in naprej deli z avtorjem, ki ga ureja in briše. Odstopite lahko kadarkoli: post ostane, brez vašega imena."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post is not listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your credit."
msgstr "Postava ni navedena na vašem profilu. Glasove, komentarje in naprej deli z avtorjem, ki ga ureja in briše. Odstopite lahko kadarkoli: post ostane, brez vaših zaslug."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post refused the change."
msgstr "Postava je zavrnila spremembo."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post stays where it is, with your name taken off it, and leaves your profile. Its Rep leaves you too. Everyone who saw it with your name still knows it was you."
msgstr "Pošta ostane tam, kjer je, s črtanim imenom in zapusti tvoj profil. Tudi vi ostanete. Vsi, ki so ga videli s tvojim imenom, še vedno vedo, da si bil ti."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author"
msgstr "Avtor posta"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author deleted it, so it is shown as Anonymous: no name and no link. The comments under it stay as they were; one its author deleted is shown as Anonymous too."
msgstr "Avtor pošte jo je izbrisal, zato je prikazana kot Anonimna: brez imena in povezave. Komentarji pod njim ostanejo takšni, kot so bili; eden od avtorjev, ki je izbrisan, je prikazan tudi kot Anonimni."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The promo code `%(code)s` is not currently valid. Please begin a new transaction."
msgstr "Promo koda `%(code)s` trenutno ni veljavna. Začnite z novo transakcijo."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The proposal for @%(name)s has been withdrawn."
msgstr "Predlog za @%(name)s je bil umaknjen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was deleted."
msgstr "Vloga %(role)s je bila izbrisana."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was made."
msgstr "Vloga %(role)s je bila narejena."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was saved."
msgstr "Vloga %(role)s je bila shranjena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The royal bank has told us that you owe them some coin. You'll need to pay off your debts before you can continue."
msgstr "Kraljeva banka nam je povedala, da jim dolguješ nekaj denarja. Moral boš odplačati dolgove, preden lahko nadaljuješ."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules below"
msgstr "Spodnja pravila"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The rules can be at most %(count)s character."
msgid_plural "The rules can be at most %(count)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Pravila so lahko največ %(count)s znakov."
msgstr[1] "Pravila so lahko največ %(count)s znakov."
msgstr[2] "Pravila so lahko največ %(count)s znakov."
msgstr[3] "Pravila so lahko največ %(count)s znakov."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules can't contain control or invisible characters."
msgstr "Pravila ne morejo vsebovati nadzornih ali nevidnih likov."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The screenshot you are sending"
msgstr "Posnetek zaslona, ki ga pošiljate"

#. %(status)s is an HTTP status code
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answered %(status)s."
msgstr "Strežnik je odgovoril %(status)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answers with the posts to show and their order; %(site)s still hides anything a viewer may not see, and tells the server nothing about who is looking. Everyone is told that an outside server ranks this curation."
msgstr "Strežnik odgovarja z objavami, ki naj se prikažejo, in njihovim naročilom; %(site)s še vedno skriva vse, česar gledalec ne vidi, in strežniku ne pove ničesar o tem, kdo gleda. Vsem je rečeno, da zunanji strežnik uvršča ta kuriran vir."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server named %(num)s post; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgid_plural "The server named %(num)s posts; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgstr[0] "Strežnik imenovan %(num)s post; od njih si lahko ogledate %(seen)s."
msgstr[1] "Strežnik je imenoval %(num)s objav; od njih si lahko ogledate %(seen)s."
msgstr[2] "Strežnik je imenoval %(num)s objave; od njih si lahko ogledate %(seen)s."
msgstr[3] "Strežnik je imenoval %(num)s objav; od njih lahko vidite %(seen)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The server thinks you're asking something silly. It might take you more seriously if you take off the jester outfit."
msgstr "Strežnik misli, da sprašuješ nekaj neumnega. Bolj resno te bo vzelo, če snameš norčevo obleko."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site refused the bot's session."
msgstr "Stran je zavrnila robotovo sejo."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins have it already."
msgstr "Upravitelji strani ga že imajo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site's admins marked this guild sensitive, so only an admin can change this."
msgstr "Administratorji spletne strani so označili to guild občutljivo, tako da lahko samo admin to spremeni."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins will read it. They are never told who reported."
msgstr "Upravitelji strani ga bodo prebrali. Nikoli jim ne povedo, kdo je poročal."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The stage is full (%(num)s person)."
msgid_plural "The stage is full (%(num)s people)."
msgstr[0] "Oder je poln (%(num)s oseba)."
msgstr[1] "Oder je poln (%(num)s osebi)."
msgstr[2] "Oder je poln (%(num)s ljudje)."
msgstr[3] "Oder je poln (%(num)s oseb)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The storage service is not answering right now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Skladišče se trenutno ne oglaša. Poskusite znova v trenutku."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The summary can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The summary can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Povzetek je lahko največ %(num)s znak."
msgstr[1] "Povzetek je lahko največ %(num)s znaka."
msgstr[2] "Povzetek je lahko največ %(num)s znakov."
msgstr[3] "Povzetek je lahko največ %(num)s znakov."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The summary can be changed while the Space is live."
msgstr "Povzetek se lahko spremeni, dokler je Vesolje v živo."

