msgstr "Vaš račun je starostno omejen, zato njegova beseda filter ostane na Child, dokler ne potrdite svoje starosti v Nastavitve."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is age-restricted, so sensitive content stays hidden until you confirm your age in Settings."
msgstr "Vaš račun je starostno omejen, tako občutljiva vsebina ostane skrita, dokler ne potrdite svoje starosti v Nastavitve."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is being checked"
msgstr "Vaš račun se preverja"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is being checked."
msgstr "Vaš račun se preverja."

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "Your account is locked until your age is confirmed, since %(date)s."
msgstr "Vaš račun je zaklenjen, dokler vaša starost ni potrjena, od %(date)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is marked sensitive."
msgstr "Vaš račun je občutljiv."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is no longer marked sensitive."
msgstr "Vaš račun ni več označen kot občutljiv."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your account is on hold"
msgstr "Vaš račun je na čakanju"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is suspended."
msgstr "Vaš račun je suspendiran."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is too new to write in this guild's channels yet."
msgstr "Tvoj račun je še preveč nov, da bi pisal v Guildove kanale."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is waiting for a quick check before it can do this. To skip the wait, verify an email address in Settings > Security."
msgstr "Vaš račun čaka na hiter pregled, preden to naredi. Če želite preskočiti čakanje, preverite e- poštni naslov v Nastavitve > Varnost."

#, machine, plain1
msgid ""
"Your account is waiting for a quick check before you can post, comment, vote or follow. You can look around and set up your profile in the meantime.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"To skip the wait, add and verify an email address in [Settings > Security](/settings/security)."
msgstr ""
"Vaš račun čaka na hiter pregled, preden lahko objavite, komentirate, glasujete ali sledite. Medtem se lahko razgledate in postavite svoj profil.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Če želite preskočiti čakanje, dodajte in preverite e-poštni naslov v [Nastavitve > Varnost](/settings/security)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is your own now. It no longer has the child lock and your parent or guardian can no longer see it. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr "Tvoj račun je zdaj tvoj. Nima več ključavnice za otroka in tvoj oče ali skrbnik je ne vidita več. Izbrali so vaše geslo: spremenite ga v [Nastavitve > Varnost](/settings/security), ali pa se še vedno lahko prijavite kot vi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account needs to be at least 30 days old to post automatically."
msgstr "Vaš račun mora biti star vsaj 30 dni, da se samodejno objavi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account needs to be at least 30 days old to run a bot."
msgstr "Tvoj račun mora biti star vsaj 30 dni, da vodi robota."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account no longer posts automatically. Its posts stay."
msgstr "Vaš račun ni več samodejno objav. Njegove objave ostanejo."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your account only reads for now, so it can't comment. You can still vote, follow and bookmark."
msgstr "Vaš račun se bere samo za zdaj, zato ne more komentirati. Še vedno lahko glasujete, sledite in zaznamek."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account posts from these feeds from now on."
msgstr "Od zdaj naprej bodo vaše objave iz teh virov."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account was closed"
msgstr "Vaš račun je bil zaprt"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account's automated posting has been paused: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Avtomatska objava računa je bila prekinjena: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account's automated posting is running again."
msgstr "Avtomatska objava računa spet teče."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account's automated posting stopped reading %(url)s after %(fails)s failed tries: %(reason)s Start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgstr "Samodejno objavljanje računa je prenehalo brati %(url)s po %(fails)s neuspešni poskusi: %(reason)s Znova zaženi iz Nastavitve > Bots, ko bo delovalo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account's automated posting was approved. Your feeds' new posts appear on your profile, marked as automated, within a few minutes. Manage it in [Settings > Bots](/settings/bots)."
msgstr "Avtomatska objava računa je odobrena. Na vašem profilu se pojavijo nove objave, označene kot avtomatizirane, v nekaj minutah. Upravljajte ga v [Nastavitve > Bots](/settings/bots)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your age"
msgstr "Starost"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your age was confirmed on %(date)s."
msgstr "Vaša starost je potrjena na %(date)s."

