"Your appeal of %(decision_link)s was accepted, and the decision was reversed.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"
msgstr ""
"Vaša pritožba %(decision_link)s je bila sprejeta in odločitev je bila obrnjena.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid ""
"Your appeal of %(decision_link)s was looked at, and the decision stands.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"
msgstr ""
"Vaša pritožba %(decision_link)s je pogledal, in odločitev stoji.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid ""
"Your appeal of %(decision_link)s was not taken further.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"
msgstr ""
"Vaša pritožba do %(decision_link)s ni bila sprejeta.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid ""
"Your appeal of the hold on your account was accepted, and the hold was lifted. You can post, comment and vote again.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"
msgstr ""
"Vaša pritožba na vaš račun je bila sprejeta in hramba je bila preklicana. Lahko objavite, komentar in glas znova.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid ""
"Your appeal of the hold on your account was looked at, and the hold stands.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"
msgstr ""
"Pregledali so vašo pritožbo na vaš račun.\n"
"\n"
"%(note_block)s"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
