msgstr "Vaši blokirani in zamolkli računi kot datoteka, ki jo lahko hranite ali prinesete na drug račun."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your bot @%(name)s has been paused: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Vaš robot @ %(name)s je bil prekinjen: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your bot @%(name)s is running again."
msgstr "Vaš robot.%(name)s Spet teče."

#. %(fails)s is a number of failed tries in a row (at least 10); %(reason)s is
#. the last error, a sentence.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your bot @%(name)s stopped reading %(url)s after %(fails)s failed tries: %(reason)s Start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgstr "Vaš robot.%(name)s ustavljeno branje %(url)s po %(fails)s neuspešni poskusi: %(reason)s Znova zaženi iz Nastavitve > Bots, ko bo delovalo."

#, python-format
msgid "Your bot [@%(name)s](/@%(name)s) was approved. It starts posting within a few minutes. Manage it in [Settings > Bots](/settings/bots)."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your bots"
msgstr "Vaši roboti"

#, glossary, machine, plain2
msgid "Your channels"
msgstr "Tvoji kanali"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat apps"
msgstr "Aplikacije za klepet"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat devices"
msgstr "Naprave za klepet"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat devices can't be listed right now."
msgstr "Vaših naprav za klepet trenutno ni mogoče navesti."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your chat encryption was started over. Messages from before can't be read on your devices unless a browser where you used chat brings them back. If this wasn't you, change your password in [Settings > Security](/settings/security)."
msgstr "Tvoje šifriranje se je začelo. Sporočila od prej ni mogoče brati na vaših napravah, razen če jih brskalnik, kjer ste uporabljali klepet, vrne. Če to niste bili vi, spremenite geslo v [Nastavitve > Varnost](/settings/security)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chats and their keys have been removed from this browser."
msgstr "Vaši klepeti in njihovi ključi so bili odstranjeni iz tega brskalnika."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chats are end-to-end encrypted, and the site can't read them. The key that opens them is kept locked: once with your password, and once with the recovery code you saved when chat was set up. If you forget your password, that code is the only way to read your old messages after a reset."
msgstr "Vaši klepeti so šifrirani in stran jih ne more prebrati. Ključ, ki jih odpre, je zaklenjen: enkrat z vašim geslom, enkrat pa s kodo za obnovitev, ki ste jo shranili ob nastavitvi klepeta. Če pozabite geslo, je ta koda edini način, da preberete stara sporočila po resetiranju."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your chats run on Matrix, an open standard, on %(site)s's own chat server. Besides Chat on this site, you can use them in a Matrix app such as Element (web, desktop and the classic phone apps), FluffyChat or Cinny. They stay end-to-end encrypted there too."
msgstr "Vaši klepeti tečejo na Matrix, odprt standard, na %(site)sLastni strežnik za klepet. Poleg tega. Klepetajte na tej spletni strani, lahko jih uporabite v aplikaciji Matrix, kot je Element (spletna, namizna in klasična telefonska aplikacija), FluffyChat ali CinnyTudi tam ostanejo šifrirani."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your child accounts will be deleted with yours."
msgstr "Računi vašega otroka bodo izbrisani z vašim."

#, glossary, machine, plain2
