msgstr "Vaša povratna informacija je bila označena kot fiksna: \"%(excerpt)s\""

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your feedback was marked fixed: \"%(excerpt)s\". Our response: %(response)s"
msgstr "Vaša povratna informacija je bila označena kot fiksna: \"%(excerpt)s\". Naš odgovor: %(response)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your followers"
msgstr "Tvoji sledilci"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your guilds"
msgstr "Vaše čete"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your inquiry has been saved."
msgstr "Vaša preiskava je rešena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your language"
msgstr "Vaš jezik"

#. the English uses "sign-ins" for every number
#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "Your last %(num)s sign-ins. The place is only the country, worked out from the connection. Don't recognise one? Change your password: that signs out every other device."
msgid_plural "Your last %(num)s sign-ins. The place is only the country, worked out from the connection. Don't recognise one? Change your password: that signs out every other device."
msgstr[0] "Zadnjih %(num)s prijav. Kraj je samo država, obdelan iz povezave. Ga ne prepoznaš? Spremenite geslo: ki odklopi vse druge naprave."
msgstr[1] "Zadnji dve prijavi. Kraj je samo država, obdelan iz povezave. Ga ne prepoznaš? Spremenite geslo: ki odklopi vse druge naprave."
msgstr[2] "Zadnji trije vpisi. Kraj je samo država, obdelan iz povezave. Ga ne prepoznaš? Spremenite geslo: ki odklopi vse druge naprave."
msgstr[3] "Zadnjih %(num)s prijav. Kraj je samo država, obdelan iz povezave. Ga ne prepoznaš? Spremenite geslo: ki odklopi vse druge naprave."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your media storage is no longer connected."
msgstr "Vaše shranjevanje ni več povezano."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your media storage needs connecting again."
msgstr "Tvoje shranjevanje medijev se mora spet povezati."

#, python-format
msgid "Your membership of [+%(guild)s](/+%(guild)s) ended: you didn't have the %(coins)s coins it renews for. You can join again from its page."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your membership will renew again."
msgstr "Vaše članstvo se bo ponovno obnovilo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your membership won't renew. You keep access until the day you paid to."
msgstr "Tvoje članstvo se ne bo obnovilo. Dostop imaš do dneva, ko si plačal."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your message includes a word this guild doesn't allow."
msgstr "Vaše sporočilo vključuje besedo, ki je ta ceh ne dopušča."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new backup codes are below. The old ones no longer work."
msgstr "Nove varnostne kode so spodaj. Stari ne delajo več."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new custom RSS Feed Token has been generated."
msgstr "Vaš novi po meri RSS Feed Token je bil ustvarjen."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new key. Copy it now: it is not shown again."
msgstr "Tvoj novi ključ. Kopiraj zdaj: ni več prikazano."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your original username will always stay reserved for you: <code>%(name)s</code>"
msgstr "Vaše izvirno uporabniško ime bo vedno ostalo rezervirano za vas: <code>%(name)s</code>"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Vaše druge naprave so izključene."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own circles"
msgstr "Vaši krogi"

#. %(who)s is the @handle of the account being added, filled in by the page
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your own circles. %(who)s is not told."
msgstr "Tvoji krogi. %(who)s se ne pove."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own mix"
msgstr "Tvoja mešanica"

#, python-format
msgid "Your own mix ranks the newest %(num)s matching post. 0 switches a part off, 10 makes it count the most."
msgid_plural "Your own mix ranks the newest %(num)s matching posts. 0 switches a part off, 10 makes it count the most."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own password"
msgstr "Lastno geslo"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian didn't agree to release your account."
msgstr "Vaš starš ali skrbnik se nista strinjala, da bo izdal vaš račun."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian has been asked to release your account. Nothing changes until they answer."
msgstr "Vašega starša ali skrbnika so prosili, naj vam izda račun. Nič se ne spremeni, dokler ne odgovorijo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian has turned this off for your account."
msgstr "Tvoj oče ali skrbnik je to izključil zaradi tvojega računa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian made this account for you. They can see what you do on the site (your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported and your recent sign-ins; the site never shows them what your chats say) and they choose which features are on. You can see which in [Settings > Content](/settings/content). They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it, because anyone who knows it can sign in as you and read your chats."
msgstr "Tvoj oče ali skrbnik je naredil račun zate. Vidijo lahko, kaj počnete na spletni strani (vaših objav, komentarjev, glasov, zaznamkov, sledi, guldnov, s katerimi klepetate, da je bil vaš račun prijavljen in vaše nedavne prijave; stran jim nikoli ne pokaže, kaj pravijo vaši klepeti) in izberejo, katere funkcije so na. Lahko vidite, kateri v [Nastavitve > Vsebina](/settings/content). Izbrali so vaše geslo: spremenite ga v [Nastavitve > Varnost](/settings/security), tako da ga poznate samo vi, ker se lahko vsakdo, ki ga pozna, vpiše kot vi in prebere vaše klepete."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your parent or guardian set a new password for your account and you were signed out. Sign in with the new password, then change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it."
msgstr "Vaš starš ali skrbnik je nastavil novo geslo za vaš račun in ste bili izključeni. Vpišite se z novim geslom, nato pa ga spremenite v [Nastavitve > Varnost](/settings/security), tako da ga poznate samo vi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian stopped managing your account. It keeps the child lock until you confirm your age in Settings > Content. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr "Vaš starš ali skrbnik je prenehal upravljati vaš račun. Otroka zaklepa, dokler ne potrdite starosti v Nastavitve > Vsebina. Izbrali so vaše geslo: spremenite ga v [Nastavitve > Varnost](/settings/security), ali pa se še vedno lahko prijavite kot vi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian's account was suspended, so yours is suspended until theirs is back."
msgstr "Tvoj račun je bil suspendiran, zato je tvoj suspendiran, dokler se ne vrne."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password"
msgstr "Vaše geslo"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your password has been changed. Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Vaše geslo je spremenjeno. Vaše druge naprave so izključene."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password meets the requirements."
msgstr "Vaše geslo ustreza zahtevam."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your payouts"
msgstr "Vaša izplačila"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone approved this. Only continue if this is your account."
msgstr "Vaš telefon je to odobril. Nadaljujte, če je to vaš račun."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone said no, so nobody was signed in."
msgstr "Vaš telefon je rekel ne, zato nihče ni bil vpisan."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your post"
msgstr "Vaša objava"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your post is listed on your profile either way. Choose My profile to have its comments there too, and add guilds to post it straight into them: each guild gets its own copy with its own votes and comments."
msgstr "Vaša objava je v vsakem primeru navedena na vašem profilu. Izberi Moj profil, da imajo svoje pripombe tudi tam, in dodajte guldne, da ga objavi naravnost v njih: vsak guld dobi svojo kopijo s svojimi glasovi in komentarji."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posting history will show here."
msgstr "Vaša objava zgodovina se bo pokazala tukaj."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts are kept out of All."
msgstr "Vaših objav ni v vseh."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts can appear in All."
msgstr "Vaše objave se lahko pojavijo v vseh."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts from the last 28 days, with what each got (a post and its guild forwards added up). Only you can see this; these are counts, never names."
msgstr "Vaši objav iz zadnjih 28 dni, s tem, kar je vsak dobil (pošta in njen guld naprej doda). Samo ti to vidiš; to so šteje, nikoli imena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts stay on your profile and in the feeds of people who follow you, but All leaves them out. Copies you forward to a guild follow that guild's own setting, and anonymous posts always appear in All, so nobody can tell which ones are yours."
msgstr "Vaše objave ostanejo na vašem profilu in v virih ljudi, ki vam sledijo, vendar jih vsi izpustijo. Kopira vas naprej na Guild sledite, da je Guild lastno nastavitev, in anonimne objave vedno pojavljajo v All, tako da nihče ne more vedeti, kateri so vaši."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "Vaš profil"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile details have been updated."
msgstr "Podrobnosti o vašem profilu so posodobljene."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your purchase was successful. A receipt will be emailed to you from Paypal."
msgstr "Vaš nakup je bil uspešen. Potrdilo vam bo poslano iz Paypala."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your roles"
msgstr "Vaše vloge"

#. a notification. %(title)s is the post's title; %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"%(title)s\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Vašega načrtovanega delovnega mesta \"%(title)s\" ni bilo mogoče objaviti: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Shranjen je v vaših osnutkih, tako da ga lahko popravite in objavite ali razpored ponovno."

#. a notification about a post with no title. %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"Untitled\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Vašega načrtovanega delovnega mesta \"Brez naslova\" ni bilo mogoče objaviti: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
